	(text "Three TMC2209-LA on one UART (addresses 0, 1, 2). Sense resistors 0.15 ohm: 1.35 A RMS full scale. VREF strap gives 0.34 A if a driver is enabled before set-up.\nCartridge plugs J7 (azimuth), J8 (altitude), J9 (roll), JST-GH 15-way: 1-2 A1, 3-4 A2, 5 GND, 6 CS, 7 SCK, 8 MOSI, 9 MISO, 10 NTC, 11 3V3, 12-13 B1, 14-15 B2."
